  - inflows and outflows kept apart;
  - event cash split by kind (a stopped legal cost counts as an outflow ending, not a receipt);
  - the day's processing order from spec §2.2;
  - the general-nonpayment day;
  - the Chain reading its cash from the engine run it already makes.

